 ('Theatre foyer',[('Fan','Did the final speech work?','O discurso final funcionou?'),('Critic','Yes, we hear the speech we watched being written.','Sim, ouvimos o discurso que vimos ser escrito.'),('Fan','Any flaws?','Algum defeito?'),('Critic','The subplot feels grafted on.','A subtrama parece enxertada.')]),
 [('Open a review with Rarely.','Abra.','Rarely has a debut felt so assured.'),('Use pay off.','Use.','The risky ending pays off.'),('Give a fair criticism.','Critique.','The monologue overstays its welcome.')],
 ('Write a 6-sentence review of a real or imagined play or film about politics or public speaking, with praise, criticism and a recommendation.','Rarely has a political thriller been so quiet. The film follows an aide through one sleepless night before a vote. The script is tightly written, and the lead performance is a model of restraint. Not every scene lands, however; the romance feels unnecessary. Even so, the ending pays off. I recommend it to anyone who thinks politics is only noise.',['Usei **Rarely + inversão**','Usei **pay off**','Dei **recomendação**'],'6 frases'),
